      "text": "Let \\( f(x) = \\sqrt{\\frac{x}{3}} \\) and \\( g(x) = \\frac{2 x}{5} - \\frac{1}{5} \\). Let R be the region bounded by the graphs of f and g and the x-axis. By integrating with respect to y, find the exact area of R.",
